---
<section class="repro-hub">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hub-header">
      <h2>Reproducibility & Trust Dashboard</h2>
      <p>This project adheres to the highest standards of computational reproducibility. All models, data, and pipelines can be verified in real-time.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="hub-grid">
      <div class="hub-card">
        <div class="status pass">PASSING</div>
        <h3>DVC Data Pipeline</h3>
        <p>The entire data lineage from raw archives to analysis panels is tracked and verified via Data Version Control.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/AntonEbsen/Demography" target="_blank" class="hub-link">View DAG &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="hub-card">
        <div class="status pass">PASSING</div>
        <h3>Statistical Unit Tests</h3>
        <p>Rigorous econometric assumption checks (VIF, Durbin-Watson, Hausman) are executed automatically via pytest.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/AntonEbsen/Demography/tree/main/tests" target="_blank" class="hub-link">View Tests &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-card">
        <div class="status active">INTERACTIVE</div>
        <h3>Browser Sandbox</h3>
        <p>Run the exact Python econometrics environment directly in your browser using WebAssembly (Zero setup required).</p>
        <a href="/sandbox/index.html" target="_blank" class="hub-btn">Launch JupyterLite</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .repro-hub {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #151619, #0b0c0e);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 4rem 0;
  }
  .hub-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .hub-header h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hub-header p { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .hub-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .hub-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .hub-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .status {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.5rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1rem;
  }
  .status.pass { background: rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.1); color: #2ecc71; border: 1px solid #2ecc71; }
  .status.active { background: rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.1); color: #3498db; border: 1px solid #3498db; }
  .hub-card h3 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text); }
  .hub-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .hub-link { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hub-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .hub-btn:hover { background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1); }
</style>
